WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.200
worry," Terrell said.

2
00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:20.864
"The Tang Monk has two other companions—Zhu Bajie and Sha Wujing."

3
00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:22.826
The first man shook his head.

4
00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:25.187
"The demons captured them too."

5
00:00:25.828 --> 00:00:27.028
The second man looked down.

6
00:00:27.048 --> 00:00:29.370
"It's very sad."

7
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.591
The third man started to cry.

8
00:00:33.652 --> 00:00:34.653
Terrell bit his lip.

9
00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:37.314
Nobody was around to save Wukong's friends.

10
00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.675
"Except me," he thought.

11
00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:41.356
He looked at the men.

12
00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:44.038
"Do you know where the demons took them?"

13
00:00:44.898 --> 00:00:45.579
The men nodded.

14
00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:47.960
"Take me there," Terrell said.

15
00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:50.741
They soon arrived at a cave.

16
00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:52.582
One man pointed.

17
00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:55.744
"The Tang Monk and his companions are in there."

18
00:00:56.545 --> 00:00:58.926
Terrell took a deep breath and stepped inside the cave.

19
00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.608
The air was cold and damp.

20
00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.478
"Hello?" Boom!

21
00:01:06.538 --> 00:01:07.639
Terrell spun around.

22
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.581
A huge boulder blocked the entrance!

23
00:01:11.502 --> 00:01:12.523
Outside, light sparkled.

24
00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:14.664
The three men disappeared.

25
00:01:15.185 --> 00:01:16.506
Demons stood in their places.

26
00:01:17.106 --> 00:01:18.547
The plant demon scratched his head.

27
00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:21.189
"Was he a person or a demon?"

28
00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.151
The little demon shrugged.

29
00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:26.173
"I think he was a person inside a demon."

30
00:01:26.193 --> 00:01:28.055
"Who cares?"

31
00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:29.696
the crocodile demon said.

32
00:01:30.228 --> 00:01:33.931
"Let's find the Tang Monk so we can start living forever!"

33
00:01:35.873 --> 00:01:39.316
"Grr!" Terrell pushed the boulder, but it didn't budge.

34
00:01:39.336 --> 00:01:41.618
"Silly, you!"

35
00:01:42.739 --> 00:01:44.060
Bippo projected a portal.

36
00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.002
They stepped through and were back outside the cave.

37
00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:49.124
Terrell grinned.

38
00:01:49.144 --> 00:01:51.226
"I forgot you could do that.

39
00:01:51.826 --> 00:01:52.567
Thanks, Bippo!"

40
00:01:53.047 --> 00:01:54.388
"Helper, me!"

41
00:01:55.189 --> 00:01:56.710
Terrell's smile quickly faded.

42
00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.432
"Those people trapped us.

43
00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:00.597
What if they were the demons?

44
00:02:01.317 --> 00:02:02.358
We have to stop them!"

45
00:02:03.199 --> 00:02:03.879
He looked around.

46
00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:06.400
"But where did they go?"

47
00:02:07.461 --> 00:02:08.802
Bippo flew above the trees.

48
00:02:08.822 --> 00:02:12.184
"See them, me!"

49
00:02:13.485 --> 00:02:17.687
Terrell and Bippo hurried and soon found three demons attacking Wukong's friends!

50
00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:20.789
Bajie swung his rake at a crocodile demon.

51
00:02:21.369 --> 00:02:23.631
"I thought Wukong chased you away!"

52
00:02:24.131 --> 00:02:24.971
The demon smiled.

53
00:02:26.656 --> 00:02:28.817
"Nope!" Wujing struck a plant demon with his spear.

54
00:02:29.217 --> 00:02:31.378
Poof! A leaf fell to the ground.

55
00:02:31.398 --> 00:02:32.639
"Let go!"

56
00:02:33.139 --> 00:02:35.220
The Tang Monk shook a little demon off his leg.

57
00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:36.620
The demon hit a rock.

58
00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.881
"I'm sorry!"

59
00:02:39.302 --> 00:02:40.442
The Tang Monk hurried over.

60
00:02:40.462 --> 00:02:43.804
"I didn't mean to hurt—" "Grr!"

61
00:02:44.304 --> 00:02:45.284
The little demon jumped.

62
00:02:45.304 --> 00:02:47.905
"Ahh!" The Tang Monk ran.

63
00:02:47.925 --> 00:02:49.786
Bippo fired his laser.

64
00:02:50.146 --> 00:02:53.568
Poof! The demon turned into a snail.

65
00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:57.250
The crocodile demon dodged Wujing's spear.

66
00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.491
Bajie's rake came down fast.

67
00:02:59.931 --> 00:03:00.772
The demon ducked.

68
00:03:01.352 --> 00:03:02.873
Terrell jumped and landed on it.

69
00:03:04.274 --> 00:03:07.036
Poof! He picked up his foot and saw a newt.

70
00:03:08.597 --> 00:03:10.999
Bajie and Wujing aimed their weapons at Terrell.

71
00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:12.460
"Who are you?"

72
00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:13.741
Wujing asked.

73
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:16.362
Terrell quickly opened the robot's head.

74
00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.524
The Tang Monk smiled.

75
00:03:18.544 --> 00:03:21.126
"Terrell! What are you doing here?"

76
00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:24.308
Terrell told them everything he knew.

77
00:03:25.012 --> 00:03:25.852
Bajie laughed.

78
00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:30.014
"Wukong is stuck in a cage?"

79
00:03:30.914 --> 00:03:31.994
The Tang Monk frowned.

80
00:03:32.534 --> 00:03:34.175
"It's not funny, Bajie."

81
00:03:34.695 --> 00:03:35.855
Wujing shook his head.

82
00:03:35.875 --> 00:03:38.596
"Bajie, you should be ashamed."

83
00:03:39.416 --> 00:03:40.337
Bajie shrugged.

84
00:03:40.357 --> 00:03:42.857
"He laughed at me when I was in jail."

85
00:03:42.877 --> 00:03:47.199
"Rocket Girl and Kid Comet are with Wukong," Terrell said.

86
00:03:47.219 --> 00:03:49.259
"I'm sure they'll escape.

87
00:03:49.759 --> 00:03:51.500
But I need to stop the earthquakes.

88
00:03:52.144 --> 00:03:54.966
Wukong said I should find the bodhisattva Guanyin."

89
00:03:55.766 --> 00:03:59.108
"Yes, perhaps she can help you," the Tang Monk said.

90
00:03:59.128 --> 00:04:00.949
"Bajie will take you to her."

91
00:04:03.411 --> 00:04:06.833
Soon Terrell, Bippo, and Bajie were soaring over the sea.

92
00:04:09.034 --> 00:04:10.515
Bright light filled the sky.

93
00:04:11.115 --> 00:04:14.497
A large bird appeared, carrying an old vase in one of its claws.

94
00:04:14.517 --> 00:04:17.479
"I know why you're here," the bird said.

95
00:04:17.499 --> 00:04:18.600
"Follow me!"
